             PGM
/*****************************************************************/
/*** PROGRAM:  MCXCLMCBCK                                      ***/
/*** PURPOSE:  TO DELTE ALL *PGM OBJECTS IN MCBCK              ***/
/***           THESE *PGM OBJECTS START WITH A C, M, S, OR T.  ***/
/***           ALSO DELETE *FILE OBJECTS STARTING WITH Z.      ***/
/*****************************************************************/
             DLTPGM     PGM(MCBCK/C*)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             DLTPGM     PGM(MCBCK/M*)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             DLTPGM     PGM(MCBCK/S*)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             DLTPGM     PGM(MCBCK/T*)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             DLTF       FILE(MCBCK/Z*)
             MONMSG     MSGID(CPF0000)
             ENDPGM
